<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu 1996 profits, sales by division.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu 1996 profits, sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining and metals group</p>
<p>Outokumpu Oy on Monday gave the following breakdown by</p>
<p>business group of its 1996 results (million markka):</p>
<p>    Net sales:		     1996	   1995</p>
<p> Base Metals			4,766	  3,869</p>
<p> Stainless Steel		  4,486	  5,655</p>
<p> Copper Products		  7,495	  7,291</p>
<p> Technology			 1,113	  1,074</p>
<p> Other operations		 1,475	  1,520</p>
<p> Intra-group sales	     -2,786	 -2,457</p>
<p> TOTAL			     16,549	 16,952</p>
<p>    Operating profit:	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Base Metals			 -386	   -442</p>
<p> Stainless Steel		    616	  1,756</p>
<p> Copper Products		    273	    388</p>
<p> Technology			   114	     76</p>
<p> Other operations		   -46	   -180</p>
<p> Intra-group items		  -19	     -9</p>
<p> TOTAL				  552	  1,589</p>
<p>    Profit before extras, tax: 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Base Metals			 -700	   -528</p>
<p> Stainless Steel		    616	  1,776</p>
<p> Copper Products		     74	    164</p>
<p> Technology			   118	     76</p>
<p> Other operations		   142		1</p>
<p> Intra-group items		  -21	     -8</p>
<p> TOTAL				  229	  1,481</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
